<div class="card">
  <h1>Team Incentives</h1>
  <p class="muted">Only people with "Manage team incentives" can see this page. Staff never see an order's profit or another person's amount. Every change is recorded in the audit log.</p>
  <p><a href="/incentives/ready">Ready to lock ({{ readyCount }})</a> · <a href="/incentives/payouts">Incentive payouts</a> · <a href="/associates">Associates</a> · <a href="/pricing/settings">Global pricing settings (incentive % or amount)</a></p>

  <form method="post" action="/incentives/settings">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
    <fieldset><legend>Program</legend>
      <label class="setting-row"><span class="setting-label">Incentive program on<small class="muted">On: every order gets the team incentive of the global rule (Global pricing settings: a % of profit or a fixed amount; a product may have its own). Off: no order gets one, unless the MD sets one by hand on an order. Associates are still paid under their agreements.</small></span>
        <input type="checkbox" name="program_enabled" value="1"{{ ' checked' if settings.enabled }}></label>
      <label class="setting-row"><span class="setting-label">Remind the MD before a payout run (days)<small class="muted">Orders ready to lock but not locked are listed to the MD this many days before each payout run ({{ runLabel }}). 0 = no reminder.</small></span>
        <input type="number" name="lock_reminder_days" min="0" max="28" step="1" required value="{{ settings.reminder_days }}" placeholder="e.g. 3"></label>
      <p class="alert alert-info">Nothing locks by itself: an order is <strong>ready to lock</strong> once the buyer has fully paid and no claim is open; the MD locks it (one by one or all ready). The team is paid in the payout run after the lock date; an associate on their due date.</p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset><legend>Incentive roles and their usual shares</legend>
      <p class="muted small">An editable list. The usual shares of the active roles must add up to 100% (now {{ roleTotalText }}%). On each order the MD can untick a role (its share spreads over the others) or set the shares. A role used on orders or payouts can only be deactivated.{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' Only the MD can change the roles.' }}</p>
      <table class="list"><tr><th>Role</th><th>Usual share (%)</th><th>Active</th><th></th></tr>
        {% for r in roles %}
          <tr>
            <td><input type="text" name="roles[{{ r.role_key }}][label]" required maxlength="80" value="{{ r.label }}" aria-label="Role name" placeholder="e.g. Sales"{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' disabled' }}></td>
            <td><input type="number" name="roles[{{ r.role_key }}][share_pct]" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" required value="{{ r.shareText | replace(',', '') }}" aria-label="{{ r.label }} share" placeholder="e.g. 30"{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' disabled' }}></td>
            <td><input type="checkbox" name="roles[{{ r.role_key }}][is_active]" value="1"{{ ' checked' if r.is_active }} aria-label="{{ r.label }} active"{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' disabled' }}></td>
            <td>{% if canManagePricing %}<button type="submit" class="btn-sm btn-secondary" formaction="/incentives/roles/{{ r.role_key | urlencode }}/delete" formnovalidate data-confirm="Delete the role {{ r.label }}? Only possible if it was never used.">Delete</button>{% endif %}</td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        {% if canManagePricing %}
          <tr>
            <td><input type="text" name="new_role_label" maxlength="80" aria-label="New role name" placeholder="New role, e.g. Quality"></td>
            <td><input type="number" name="new_role_share" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" aria-label="New role share" placeholder="e.g. 5"></td>
            <td colspan="2" class="muted small">Add a role (lower another share so they still add up to 100%).</td>
          </tr>
        {% endif %}
      </table>
    </fieldset>

    {# D-259 (owner approval 6 Nov 2026): caps per role. #}
    <fieldset id="incentive-caps"><legend>Caps</legend>
      <p class="muted small">The most one person can receive. Empty = no cap. Anything above the cap stays with the company (it is not shared out to others). Per order: the most from one order. Per month: the most across all orders locked in one calendar month. Applies only to orders not yet locked.{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' Only the MD can change the caps.' }}</p>
      {% if canManagePricing %}<input type="hidden" name="caps_present" value="1">{% endif %}
      <table class="list"><tr><th>Role</th><th>Max per person per order (&#8377;)</th><th>Max per person per month (&#8377;)</th></tr>
        {% for r in roles %}{% if r.is_active %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ r.label }}</td>
            <td><input type="number" name="caps[{{ r.role_key }}][order]" min="0" max="1000000000" step="0.01" value="{{ r.capOrderText }}" aria-label="{{ r.label }} cap per order" placeholder="No cap, e.g. 15000"{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' disabled' }}></td>
            <td><input type="number" name="caps[{{ r.role_key }}][month]" min="0" max="1000000000" step="0.01" value="{{ r.capMonthText }}" aria-label="{{ r.label }} cap per month" placeholder="No cap, e.g. 40000"{{ '' if canManagePricing else ' disabled' }}></td>
          </tr>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </table>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset><legend>Each person's incentive role</legend>
      <p class="muted small">Who usually does which role. On each order, the people assigned to it with that role get it (or everyone with the role, if none is assigned); the MD can change it on the order.</p>
      <input type="hidden" name="user_roles_present" value="1">
      <table class="list">
        <tr><th>Person</th>{% for r in activeRoles %}<th>{{ r.label }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
        {% for u in users %}
          <tr><td>{{ u.name }} <small class="muted">{{ u.role_name or '' }}</small></td>
            {% for r in activeRoles %}
              <td><input type="checkbox" name="user_roles[u{{ u.id }}][]" value="{{ r.key }}"{{ ' checked' if (r.key in (userRoles[u.id] or [])) }} aria-label="{{ u.name }} — {{ r.label }}"></td>
            {% endfor %}
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    </fieldset>

    <div class="btn-row"><button type="submit">Save</button></div>
  </form>
</div>
